<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"><title>Sysop portal • TARPN #gapacket</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="sysop.css?v=1"><script defer src="sysop.js?v=1"></script></head><body><header><a href="/gapacket/">AF4H / TARPN #gapacket</a><span>Sysop portal</span><button id="logout" hidden>Sign out</button></header><main><p id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite">Checking sign-in…</p><section id="login"><h1>Sysop sign-in</h1><p>Enter a registered sysop callsign. A single-use login link will be emailed to the address on file.</p><form id="login-form"><label>Sysop callsign<input name="callsign" required placeholder="N0CALL" maxlength="15" autocomplete="username"></label><button>Send login link</button></form><div id="finish-login" hidden><p>Use this link to start an eight-hour sysop session.</p><button id="consume">Sign in</button></div></section><section id="portal" hidden><h1 id="welcome">Station management</h1><p>Sysop station changes take effect immediately and are recorded in the audit trail. End-user changes continue to require email approval.</p><nav aria-label="Management sections"><button data-tab="stations">Stations</button><button data-tab="links">Links</button><button data-tab="sysops">Sysops</button><button data-tab="keys">API keys</button><button data-tab="audit">Audit trail</button></nav><section id="stations" class="tab"><h2>Stations</h2><div class="table-wrap" id="station-list"></div><form id="station-form"><h3>Add or edit a station</h3><label>Callsign<input name="callsign" required placeholder="N0CALL/14"></label><label>Address<textarea name="address" required maxlength="500"></textarea></label><label>Status<select name="status"><option>online</option><option>ready</option><option>interested</option></select></label><div class="pair"><label>Latitude<input name="lat" required type="number" step="any" min="-90" max="90"></label><label>Longitude<input name="lng" required type="number" step="any" min="-180" max="180"></label></div><button>Save station</button> <button type="reset">New / clear</button></form></section><section id="links" class="tab" hidden><h2>Links</h2><div class="table-wrap" id="link-list"></div><form id="link-form"><h3>Add or edit a link</h3><label>Stable link ID<input name="id" required maxlength="100"></label><div class="pair"><label>A-node<input name="a_node" required placeholder="N0CALL"></label><label>Z-node<input name="z_node" required placeholder="N0CALL/14"></label></div><div class="pair"><label>Frequency (Hz, optional)<input name="frequency_hz" type="number" min="1" step="1"></label><label>Capacity (bps)<input name="capacity_bps" required type="number" min="300" max="57600" value="9600"></label></div><label>Status<select name="status"><option>online</option><option>offline</option><option>disabled</option></select></label><label>Last seen (your local time)<input name="last_seen" type="datetime-local" required></label><button>Save link</button> <button type="reset">New / clear</button><p>Only approved station endpoints receive map markers. Unlisted endpoints remain visible in connectivity details.</p></form></section><section id="sysops" class="tab" hidden><h2>Registered sysops</h2><p>Every registered sysop can manage stations, links, sysops, and API keys. Changing a sysop’s email invalidates its sessions and outstanding login links. The last sysop cannot be removed.</p><div class="table-wrap" id="sysop-list"></div><form id="sysop-form"><h3>Add or change sysop</h3><label>Base callsign<input name="callsign" required placeholder="N0CALL"></label><label>Login email on file<input name="email" required type="email" autocomplete="off"></label><button>Save sysop</button></form></section><section id="keys" class="tab" hidden><h2>Telemetry API keys</h2><p>API keys never grant sysop access. They can report only their allowed stations and capabilities. New link IDs belong to the key that first reports them.</p><div class="table-wrap" id="key-list"></div><form id="key-form"><h3>Create a key</h3><label>Name<input name="name" required maxlength="100"></label><label>Allowed listed station IDs (comma-separated)<input name="nodes" required placeholder="N0CALL/14"></label><div><label><input type="checkbox" name="scope" value="links" checked>Report links</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="scope" value="metrics" checked>Report metrics</label></div><label>Expires in days<input name="days" type="number" min="1" max="365" value="90" required></label><button>Create key</button></form><section id="new-key" hidden><h3>Copy this key now</h3><p>It is displayed only once. Store it privately in the telemetry station’s configuration. Reloading this page hides it.</p><textarea id="key-token" readonly aria-label="New telemetry API key"></textarea><button id="copy-key">Copy key</button><p>Endpoint: <code>POST /gapacket/telemetry.php</code>, using <code>Authorization: Bearer YOUR_KEY</code>. See the repository’s SYSOP.md for the payload format.</p></section></section><section id="audit" class="tab" hidden><h2>Audit trail</h2><p>Applied station and link changes show the actor and before/after values. Existing stations have a baseline entry; earlier changes cannot be reconstructed. Public station history omits addresses, emails, and secrets.</p><button id="audit-refresh">Refresh</button><div id="audit-list" class="table-wrap"></div><button id="audit-more" hidden>Older events</button></section></section></main></body></html>
